OL,3,GNEWSASchool gets new classrooms in
OL,4,A#1.6m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils at a primary school in Hucknall
OL,7,Fhave officially opened new classrooms
OL,8,Fas part of a #1.6m investment.
OL,10,FThe project, funded by the county
OL,11,Fcouncil, has replaced ageing mobile
OL,12,Fclassrooms at Leen Mills Primary School
OL,13,Fwith a new permanent building which
OL,14,Fincludes two modern classrooms.
OL,16,FThe building has been designed with a
OL,17,Frange of safety and energy-efficient
OL,18,Ffeatures, including a linked fire
OL,19,Falarm, air source heat pumps and solar
OL,20,Fpanels with the aim of helping to
OL,21,Freduce the school's energy use and
OL,22,Frunning costs.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
