OL,3,GNEWSASchool gets new classrooms in
OL,4,A#1.6m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teacher Karen Goldson said the new
OL,7,Fclassrooms provided pupils with
OL,8,F"modern, high-quality learning spaces
OL,9,Fto enhance their educational
OL,10,Fexperience".
